# Hand-written fixture: a closed unit cube and an open slab.
# Exercises: mtllib, o, g, usemtl (semantic-surface names and a plain material),
# v with a 4th w component, vt with v/vt faces, negative (relative) indices,
# a comment line and a blank line.
mtllib cube.mtl

o cube
v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 1 1 0
v 0 1 0
v 0 0 1 1.0
v 1 0 1
v 1 1 1
v 0 1 1
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 1 1
vt 0 1
g GroundSurface
usemtl GroundSurface
f 1 4 3 2
g WallSurface
usemtl brick
f 1/1 2/2 6/3 5/4
f 2/1 3/2 7/3 6/4
f 3/1 4/2 8/3 7/4
f 4/1 1/2 5/3 8/4
g RoofSurface
usemtl RoofSurface
f -4 -3 -2 -1
o slab
v 10 0 0
v 12 0 0
v 12 2 0
v 10 2 0
f 9 10 11 12
